334: | 403 | `permission_error` | `Refused { reason }` |
335: | 404 | `not_found_error` | `Other(anyhow!(...))` |
336: | 429 | `rate_limit_error` | `RateLimited { retry_after_ms: parse_retry_after_header(&resp) }` |
337: | 500–504 | `api_error` | `Unavailable` |
338: | 529 | `overloaded_error` | `Unavailable` |
339: | any | reqwest network/TLS error | `Transport(re.to_string())` |
